#: scenario8:scenario8_6651834A_DBF8_44D1_B509_2899ADE4F497
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11236782dfe447ce17886cadf2b7279d7f963c4cc38132d01815c54bd46a1a47
#. default-sha256: dfcb052ded0b8d1c44c738f2c3cd5f7e57cf20d93666b8ea2bec960273e609af
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6651834A_DBF8_44D1_B509_2899ADE4F497"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s a lot of pressure being under that much suspicion, huh. ⟪k:3⟫My heart was "
"pounding the whole time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫심장에 ⟪k:3⟫많이 해로운걸요……. ⟪k:4⟫의심받는 건 긴장되네요."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E303B542_62C2_46DA_B84D_21909C9B2717
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6cf70d5793f7a443e009e0875ab2eb0da1c57dab2a8db52bd256180c138e878c
#. default-sha256: d9f9876ac99cecd68922438b05c2c0d293b8ac3507184ec76937832f03b9c1d9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E303B542_62C2_46DA_B84D_21909C9B2717"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why’d you tell him that, anyway?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫왜 그런 소리를 ⟪k:3⟫하셨어요?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DF466BE3_9743_4EB8_8C55_126EA0D35B34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd9a11156fead73cb528ccb74b00d45be99abf315d924c1a73fce657a3a4047d
#. default-sha256: d2b093ac810b1c1f6fe78e2982d0d6b9db6eb67aa373834f9f23a70ff434df90
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DF466BE3_9743_4EB8_8C55_126EA0D35B34"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I know, I know!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Besides, you have every intention of keeping your "
"promise, don’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫저도 알아요!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫게다가 ⟪k:5⟫거짓말을 할 의도는 없었죠?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_FA8A3BEE_FC0A_4782_ABA9_359AF754BB23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2dff21b6a62c93f35cb646b4884540249ca6f5014700dec7ebfec2155e08941
#. default-sha256: d5920c9be1cda907005f1d64f289ab59e4df4a852a2d242e9bb0112aea7d2829
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_FA8A3BEE_FC0A_4782_ABA9_359AF754BB23"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehehe, oh, you. You say it’s all on him,⟪k:3⟫but deep down, you know you’re on "
"his side."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫후후~, ⟪k:3⟫말론 그러고⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫실은 가만 못 두는 거 아니에요?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0C30FFB8_1082_45EC_9226_126C9FCB72AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1593f24aab8a8b06d75ae5695f613226cf292dc039b45d91b36230ce156cbd0
#. default-sha256: 24130d602def5011daa28a2a0aa64f7b61252441dec4128141101a86a21b5eee
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0C30FFB8_1082_45EC_9226_126C9FCB72AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We’re complete strangers to this Mell,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫but I can’t bring myself to think "
"of him that way."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫저도 ⟪k:3⟫멜이 생판 남 같지 않아요.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫이 시대의 멜 입장에선 ⟪k:6⟫우리가 초면"
"이겠지만……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_13D29103_8E5D_431C_8E27_B9552F151160
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc4fbadd381d7507daea2385b3a6ec653cd375bd69176e7c05af544625766617
#. default-sha256: be096a856cb33867cfc691ce97b0ce88cd03e31b656ce53c2e4c43dda1d2839d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_13D29103_8E5D_431C_8E27_B9552F151160"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And you were actually there—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫a part of his life—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫which I "
"imagine makes the sentiment all the stronger."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그대는 멜의 인생에 관여했기에……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫더욱 그렇겠군요……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F66292A8_AABF_483E_89EA_5C109E89F5F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80c34ccd2b7e0be21b928db1c25dac49d1ae14225f334f242f51a50629f13f0b
#. default-sha256: e40358428b13605404bfd7f3e15f6db9706363579f6079cafed5876dabfe3239
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F66292A8_AABF_483E_89EA_5C109E89F5F7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫don’t think of him... ⟪k:3⟫as a total stranger, no.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫However..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫생판 남이나…… ⟪k:3⟫다름없게 여기진 않습니다.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫하지만……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_07A3BB64_4284_4F38_B51B_D1B2E3F52F55
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 25bb125e76ff2cc528ce19fe2f9623fc2ac159f6f6b350347f39326fa0584e6c
#. default-sha256: 7db6f16b7a101ca05cb26d6b914eb9425ca980eec7f634bf3a76bc86cb900402
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_07A3BB64_4284_4F38_B51B_D1B2E3F52F55"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s hard to say... ⟪k:3⟫but even if he doesn’t,⟪k:4⟫we still have the other two "
"men to worry about."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫글쎄요……, ⟪k:3⟫멜이 그럴 배짱이 없어도⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫다른 둘이 있잖습니까. ⟪k:6⟫행동하"
"는 건 멜이 아니어도 됩니다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_39E3BBEC_9037_4D86_A16D_CD7BD0234D3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
