msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wasn’t really... ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫there⟪k:5⟫ anymore."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫뭐가 뭔지 ⟪k:3⟫알 수 없어졌거든요."

