#: scenario8:scenario8_456D304C_18F8_49FE_B699_BB8FB0129127
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b212047fc04083aa150cc99635a0c7392e62848aa4201f5a6f29443b211c5ecf
