msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_456D304C_18F8_49FE_B699_BB8FB0129127"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He bears a great deal of regret.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫He yearns for someone to save him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫멜은 후회하고 있었습니다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……그 녀석은 누군가가 구해 주길 바랐죠."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4B497D23_0A93_44D8_962E_2C771CB1E1EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad05f080797ba7aca38084f459f3f24a6b89d0fa243d98676f386b5c0520c246
#. default-sha256: 60ec34ef933b4724e3934d0b4dae93353b222d3ec50f8d001f9cceb84229f2ec
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4B497D23_0A93_44D8_962E_2C771CB1E1EC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I heard him muttering, “This isn’t what I wanted.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He doesn’t want to be "
"involved in this."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그러려던 게 아니었다――, ⟪k:2⟫그림자는 그때 그랬습니다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫이 상황은 ⟪k:5⟫멜이 바"
"란 게 아닙니다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CFE79328_0AC0_4946_993D_4ECC03795085
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2a7197c54ba91850cf4f3b22234202d9ec8a6754cda1d975e708e8b797b9dad
#. default-sha256: 9f4e7eec946abbe308185414ffd32169762042bc65a200f2c51d57a04b194f3c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CFE79328_0AC0_4946_993D_4ECC03795085"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But we have knowledge—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫quite a bit of it, in fact."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫단…… 아는 점은 ⟪k:3⟫오히려 많을 거라 봅니다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_819984AE_39B1_4789_80C9_A07F1C3C388D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: baed089181a91022cdcaecfe40bb8416e18f0689a5b4531cf36496a5b8b051f6
#. default-sha256: d5aa01ec04ccac093ed64a025d26d32a32165436fad723647ec67818bc784a90
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_819984AE_39B1_4789_80C9_A07F1C3C388D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I agree! If his darling sister tells him to stop,⟪k:3⟫he won’t have any reason to "
"continue his involvement!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫맞아요! ⟪k:3⟫애지중지 아끼는 여동생이⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫그만하라고 하면 ⟪k:6⟫이런 짓에 의미"
"는 없어지죠!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A7B94DFA_E802_4646_8F99_1DB8BD068ED9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d02a28c11587fde3a6c87cf6f0c418d6afd2e8257b46b0974fc3aeb0df9b4036
#. default-sha256: 3462449daad55d1a47fad432fcdfcb34e7cae4454be1c35750caca50eda46964
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A7B94DFA_E802_4646_8F99_1DB8BD068ED9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫is that people tend to keep those they care most about close by."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫아끼는 상대라면⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫곁에 둘 거란…… 거였어요."

#: scenario8:scenario8_C2FB13F6_DBC2_4FEE_8C81_AC7E38251B75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f42635914aebd3e580ec1edfb403696a5653d5376975194daefa39c58a8fb4c
#. default-sha256: b374d9693acc48e926452baaa63391f301adefab31a1c7f0d5abc694fe3806e9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C2FB13F6_DBC2_4FEE_8C81_AC7E38251B75"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(It would appear I have a bad tendency to focus too much on the facts.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(내 사고는 영 ⟪k:2⟫사실만 추구하려 하는군)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_837E4EB5_6197_46D7_B145_2F8C50D9FDE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 623cf3ff1a55397b1d1d8ff73cc79df5849cbe62963e9b7ef4041d8f91e34929
#. default-sha256: 93279b248551c6765f5f8fa480c3362d89192e6f77d6988c3a559d74f28825b5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_837E4EB5_6197_46D7_B145_2F8C50D9FDE4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(That was entirely unnecessary of me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Giselle did not need to be reminded of that.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(지젤에게 ⟪k:1⟫그걸 굳이 말할 필요는 없었어.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ 지젤도 다 아는 거잖아……)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_40A770ED_D15B_4D83_B543_EDE6D1851647
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
