msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2EB39580_FF7B_4387_B185_A520655DDDAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5982e7dac5935af2a6c162fe1bc31c0297b377507bd1db0e9e31c2abbc7ec1e
#. default-sha256: 28515e615b7107980eaade766bed8821dc1826a4347175a2f165a3c05393dbf6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2EB39580_FF7B_4387_B185_A520655DDDAA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫We’ll probably have more luck asking than just searching for her. ⟪k:2⟫If we can’t find "
"Mell, the nun might know."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫무작정 찾기보단 ⟪k:2⟫남에게 묻는 게 빠르겠군요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫멜이 안 보이면 ⟪k:5⟫수도녀에게 "
"물어보겠습니다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_49B91D93_C7F9_4BB2_B3FC_8873EEEDA737
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4084e8d5071ab4dd5aad1a3d0c3e2b65173ddea8e40e348920e754690d0382b5
#. default-sha256: f94e9a779cb5016c7daf0ae9e1a2bf50301f7fffce4dc96149beab2601b81674
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_49B91D93_C7F9_4BB2_B3FC_8873EEEDA737"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The man is practically beaming, and judging by the vial in his hand,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫노인은 행복한 미소를 짓고 있었다. ⟪k:1⟫그 미소가 뜻하는 바는 ⟪k:2⟫수도녀에게 품은 신뢰와 신"
"앙 뿐만이 아니리라."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4A9271DD_A8CC_4C84_AD1C_5E56EA43DC0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 137706d2ca6776fda988e4dcddffac8d50b2080d140cccd8e8d9befe7f5c9ca5
#. default-sha256: 1ce22950db3cb1c92f2fe68c7391615bdb2231f0532d4870dd6b71f148022580
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4A9271DD_A8CC_4C84_AD1C_5E56EA43DC0A"
