"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You’re a kind person, Mell, you really are.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫So kind you played along with my "
"fantasy that you were a prince."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫오라버니는…… 착한 사람이야. ⟪k:2⟫그래서…… 넬리한테 맞춰 줬지? ⟪k:3⟫왕자님처럼 굴어 줬"
